│ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ │
│                                                                    │
│ The issue arises from inconsistent handling of type alias          │
│ documentation in the sphinx.ext.autodoc extension. Specifically,   │
│ some type aliases have incomplete or improperly formatted          │
│ docstrings that are not rendered correctly in the HTML output. The │
│ solution involves ensuring all type alias docstrings are properly  │
│ formatted to include the full documentation content.               │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
│ [file]file.py[/file] [original] ScaffoldOpts = Dict[str, Any]      │
│ """Dictionary with PyScaffold's options, see                       │
